---
---
<section class="relative bg-black text-white pt-32 pb-24 px-6 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 60% 0%, rgba(255,209,0,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);"></div>
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <span class="block text-[#FFD100] text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-6">The Money Wit School · Online Masterclass</span>
    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-6">
      Where and How<br><em class="italic text-[#FFD100]">to Invest.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white/60 max-w-xl leading-relaxed mb-10 font-light">
      The sure way to get out of the 'work to eat' rat race and have true financial independence is by investing profitably. This masterclass shows you exactly how.
    </p>
    <div class="inline-flex flex-wrap border border-white/10 mb-10">
      {[
        { icon: '⏱', text: '60 Minutes' },
        { icon: '📹', text: '1 Lesson' },
        { icon: '💳', text: 'One Time Payment' },
        { icon: '✅', text: 'Instant Access' },
      ].map((item) => (
        <div class="px-5 py-3 border-r border-white/10 last:border-r-0 text-sm text-white/50">
          {item.icon} <strong class="text-white">{item.text}</strong>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
      <a href="#pricing" class="inline-block bg-[#FFD100] text-black px-10 py-5 text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase hover:brightness-110 transition-all text-center">
        Enroll Now
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-white/35 mt-5">Course available immediately after payment · Taught by Oler Oladele, CFA</p>
  </div>
</section>
